<li>Magnitude Dini - documentary series focusing on the hard truth behind current affairs in the country. Collaboration with Tempo Digital 2</li>
<li>Uncensored with Andini Effendi - YouTube and podcast of Andini Effendi discussing inconvenient truths about certain topics in Indonesia</li>
</ul>
